{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to make Horse Racing Manager most realistic management simulation where you build and grow your own racing empire. You will make your way from small beginnings to world-class glory, every decision you make will pave your way, and you choose where it leads.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roadmap of Horse Racing Manager</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/cb8902e35d0e8bb7aafd135644b567af.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1280 height=931 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breeding with the Pseudo-DNA Feature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed bloodlines with our Pseudo-DNA system, where genetics define personality, traits and performance. Smart breeding choices can produce next champion.   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/0913f7db6d1abe1e5bb0e89eee2aa53f.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/0913f7db6d1abe1e5bb0e89eee2aa53f.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/0913f7db6d1abe1e5bb0e89eee2aa53f.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on different tracks and surfaces in events from smaller meets to major competitions. Your success depends on preparations, training and strategy, choose to either watch the simulation or take direct control and bring it home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/b09d45c7824f5ee2a4d59a1ff79db21d.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/b09d45c7824f5ee2a4d59a1ff79db21d.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/b09d45c7824f5ee2a4d59a1ff79db21d.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Training and Care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose training routines and feeding plans to develop each horse. Balancing rest, conditioning and nutrition is essential to reach horses peak potential.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/9a4cb4c466f4c4b5a5f68fb7338e8929.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/9a4cb4c466f4c4b5a5f68fb7338e8929.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/9a4cb4c466f4c4b5a5f68fb7338e8929.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and manage jockeys, trainers, veterinarians and support staff. Staff skills influence horse development, race performance, and overall stable efficiency.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/286efdd0d474997240deb9928fb5b8c5.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/286efdd0d474997240deb9928fb5b8c5.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/286efdd0d474997240deb9928fb5b8c5.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Facility Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade specialised facilities, each facility provides meaningful improvements, from boosting training and horse development to improving staff performance and race results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/70a25e5458ec8c13b7f17c201543f702.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/70a25e5458ec8c13b7f17c201543f702.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/70a25e5458ec8c13b7f17c201543f702.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auctions and Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire and sell horses through a detailed market system. Compete in auctions of varying tiers, find hidden talents, and negotiate trades with stables to improve your roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/a38f158cf9c46f5a69000a8a4815e936.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/a38f158cf9c46f5a69000a8a4815e936.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/a38f158cf9c46f5a69000a8a4815e936.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Informed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain up-to-date with a comprehensive news system that delivers the latest updates on races, competitors, and industry developments.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/dbb83fa62dea6e895340ef1c074ee292.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/dbb83fa62dea6e895340ef1c074ee292.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/dbb83fa62dea6e895340ef1c074ee292.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stable has a beginning, but only a few become legends. Take control, make the right choices and guide your stable to the top of the racing world. Horse Racing Manager is ready for you, are you ready?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2740170?t=1764628036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764628036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/fbf11a52a2fcb94ff1aa47e2546af970564f9a76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764628036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/fbf11a52a2fcb94f