se development, race performance, and overall stable efficiency.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/286efdd0d474997240deb9928fb5b8c5.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/286efdd0d474997240deb9928fb5b8c5.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/286efdd0d474997240deb9928fb5b8c5.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Facility Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade specialised facilities, each facility provides meaningful improvements, from boosting training and horse development to improving staff performance and race results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/70a25e5458ec8c13b7f17c201543f702.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/70a25e5458ec8c13b7f17c201543f702.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/70a25e5458ec8c13b7f17c201543f702.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auctions and Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire and sell horses through a detailed market system. Compete in auctions of varying tiers, find hidden talents, and negotiate trades with stables to improve your roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/a38f158cf9c46f5a69000a8a4815e936.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/a38f158cf9c46f5a69000a8a4815e936.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/a38f158cf9c46f5a69000a8a4815e936.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Informed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain up-to-date with a comprehensive news system that delivers the latest updates on races, competitors, and industry developments.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/dbb83fa62dea6e895340ef1c074ee292.poster.avif?t=1764628036\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/dbb83fa62dea6e895340ef1c074ee292.webm?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/dbb83fa62dea6e895340ef1c074ee292.mp4?t=1764628036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stable has a beginning, but only a few become legends. Take control, make the right choices and guide your stable to the top of the racing world. Horse Racing Manager is ready for you, are you ready?</p>","developers":["Sheep Meadow Road Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy",